1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Video ya leo ni kuhusu nini? Kuna mambo mengi sana!

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Sehemu ya 1: Utamaduni wa "Mottainai" na Uzoefu wa Eco / Utamaduni wa Mottainai na Uzoefu wa Mazingira

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:15,108
Umeangalia habari za asubuhi?

4
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:18,164
Hapana, sijawaona.

5
00:00:18,187 --> 00:00:23,272
Habari kuhusu "Mottainai" ya Japani.

6
00:00:23,295 --> 00:00:25,514
Mottainai?

7
00:00:25,537 --> 00:00:27,989
Ni habari gani?

8
00:00:28,012 --> 00:00:32,546
Habari kuhusu utamaduni wa kutunza vitu.

9
00:00:32,569 --> 00:00:37,102
Wajapani wanatunza vitu sana, hivi ndivyo?

10
00:00:37,125 --> 00:00:41,963
Uzoefu wa eco unawapendeza wageni sana.

11
00:00:41,987 --> 00:00:44,920
Kuna uzoefu gani?

12
00:00:44,943 --> 00:00:49,577
Kuna kafe inayopunguza upotevu wa chakula.

13
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:52,440
Wazo zuri sana!

14
00:00:52,463 --> 00:00:56,263
Wanauza vyakula kama biskuti zinazokaribia kuisha muda wake wa kuitumia.

15
00:00:56,286 --> 00:00:59,486
Unaweza kununua bei nafuu, hiyo ni nzuri!

16
00:00:59,509 --> 00:01:02,797
Kuna keki na mkate tamu sana.

17
00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:06,154
Ni vizuri kutokataa chakula, hivyo hakuna upotevu.

18
00:01:06,177 --> 00:01:09,675
Kuna uzoefu wa Kintsugi pia.

19
00:01:09,698 --> 00:01:11,832
Kintsugi?

20
00:01:11,855 --> 00:01:15,421
Ni sanaa ya kutengeneza sahani iliyovunjika.

21
00:01:15,444 --> 00:01:19,135
Hutumia dhahabu kuunganisha sehemu zilizovunjika vizuri.

22
00:01:19,159 --> 00:01:23,642
Inakuwa ya muundo mpya na nzuri.

23
00:01:23,665 --> 00:01:26,998
Maduka ya bidhaa zilizorejeshewa yana umaarufu pia.

24
00:01:27,021 --> 00:01:29,355
Ni maduka ya nguo zilizotumika, ndivyo?

25
00:01:29,378 --> 00:01:33,378
Kuna nguo na mifuko safi sana.

26
00:01:33,401 --> 00:01:37,497
Unaweza kununua nguo nzuri kwa bei nafuu.

27
00:01:37,521 --> 00:01:40,656
Watu wengi wanabeba chupa zao wenyewe.

28
00:01:40,679 --> 00:01:45,246
Unaweza kujaza maji kwenye stendi za mjini.

29
00:01:45,269 --> 00:01:48,669
Hupunguza takataka za plastiki.

30
00:01:48,692 --> 00:01:52,025
Ni juhudi zinazohifadhi dunia, hiyo ni nzuri!

31
00:01:52,048 --> 00:01:55,648
Mimi pia nataka kujihusisha na uzoefu wa eco.

32
00:01:55,671 --> 00:02:00,038
Leo tutaenda kafe ya kupunguza upotevu wa chakula?

33
00:02:00,061 --> 00:02:04,145
Ndiyo, nataka kwenda kafe hiyo.

34
00:02:04,168 --> 00:02:06,338
Iko Shibuya.

35
00:02:06,362 --> 00:02:09,895
Nitahifadhi nafasi kwa uzoefu wa Kintsugi pia.

36
00:02:09,918 --> 00:02:13,451
Unaweza kuhifadhi nafasi mtandaoni.

37
00:02:13,474 --> 00:02:16,474
Nitahifadhi nafasi mtandaoni sasa hivi.

38
00:02:16,497 --> 00:02:19,746
Kuhifadhi nafasi kunakupa amani ya akili.

39
00:02:19,770 --> 00:02:23,440
Nitakua nikisoma utamaduni wa eco wa Japani.

40
00:02:23,463 --> 00:02:26,796
Asante kwa kunisaidia habari.

41
00:02:26,819 --> 00:02:30,986
Nitakua nikifurahia utamaduni wa eco wa Japani.

42
00:02:31,009 --> 00:02:34,609
Uwe na siku nzuri!

43
00:02:34,632 --> 00:02:36,682
Ndiyo, ninaenda sasa.

44
00:02:36,705 --> 00:02:39,040
Safari njema!

45
00:02:39,064 --> 00:02:58,081
Skripu ya video ya leo inaweza kupakuliwa kutoka maelezo na maoni ya juu. Tafadhali achia maoni kabla ya kupakua.

46
00:02:58,081 --> 00:02:59,581
Sehemu ya 2: Kafe ya Kupunguza Upotevu wa Chakula / Kafe ya Kupunguza Chakula Chakachakachua

47
00:02:59,581 --> 00:03:01,748
Samahani.

48
00:03:01,771 --> 00:03:07,404
Hii ni kafe ya kupunguza upotevu wa chakula?

49
00:03:07,427 --> 00:03:09,710
Karibu sana.

50
00:03:09,733 --> 00:03:13,566
Ndiyo, ni kafe ya kupunguza upotevu wa chakula.

51
00:03:13,589 --> 00:03:16,523
Kuna bidhaa gani zinazopatikana?

52
00:03:16,546 --> 00:03:20,280
Kuna bidhaa zilizo karibu na tarehe ya mwisho ya kuliwa.

53
00:03:20,303 --> 00:03:23,670
Kuna vitafunio na mkate.

54
00:03:23,693 --> 00:03:27,569
Hizi ni vitafunio tamu tulizokusanya kutoka supermarket.

55
00:03:27,592 --> 00:03:30,625
Ni aina gani ya vitafunio unayopendekeza?

56
00:03:30,648 --> 00:03:33,982
Biskuti hizi ndizo zinazopendekezwa.

57
00:03:34,005 --> 00:03:38,677
Biskuti hizi zitakwisha lini?

58
00:03:38,700 --> 00:03:41,234
Zitakwisha kesho.

59
00:03:41,257 --> 00:03:45,990
Kwa sababu zitakwisha kesho, zimepunguzwa bei.

60
00:03:46,013 --> 00:03:49,424
Ndio, zimepunguzwa nusu bei na kuwa shilingi 200.

61
00:03:49,448 --> 00:03:52,615
Bei ya nusu ni rahisi sana!

62
00:03:52,638 --> 00:03:55,723
Ladha yake ni tamu sana.

63
00:03:55,746 --> 00:03:58,879
Nitachukua biskuti mbili.

64
00:03:58,902 --> 00:04:00,835
Asante sana.

65
00:04:00,858 --> 00:04:03,792
Je, kuna chokoleti pia?

66
00:04:03,815 --> 00:04:07,450
Ndio, kuna chokoleti ya hali ya juu.

67
00:04:07,473 --> 00:04:11,511
Chokoleti hii itakwisha lini?

68
00:04:11,535 --> 00:04:14,574
Zitakwisha kesho kutwa.

69
00:04:14,598 --> 00:04:17,038
Chokoleti ni bei gani?

70
00:04:17,061 --> 00:04:21,666
Zimepunguzwa asilimia 70 na kuwa shilingi 150.

71
00:04:21,689 --> 00:04:24,097
Shilingi 150?

72
00:04:24,121 --> 00:04:27,254
Bei ni rahisi sana!

73
00:04:27,277 --> 00:04:30,317
Badala ya kutupa, tunauza, hivyo ni eco-friendly.

74
00:04:30,341 --> 00:04:35,108
Nitachukua chokoleti mbili pia. Asante.

75
00:04:35,131 --> 00:04:38,264
Nitazunguka sehemu ya mkate pia.

76
00:04:38,287 --> 00:04:41,144
Tuna mkate wa kukaanga wa leo asubuhi.

77
00:04:41,168 --> 00:04:44,934
Umbo lake limepotea kidogo.

78
00:04:44,957 --> 00:04:48,731
Ndio, kwa sababu umbo lake si la kawaida, bei yake ni rahisi.

79
00:04:48,755 --> 00:04:54,360
Nitachukua mkate mmoja. Mkate ni shilingi 100, sawa?

80
00:04:54,384 --> 00:04:57,317
Tafadhali hesabu jumla.

81
00:04:57,340 --> 00:05:01,274
Biskuti, chokoleti na mkate ni jumla shilingi 800.

82
00:05:01,297 --> 00:05:06,737
Nitatoa noti ya elfu moja. Tunapokea shilingi 1000.

83
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:09,647
Mabaki ni shilingi 200.

84
00:05:09,671 --> 00:05:12,671
Nitaziweka kwenye mfuko wangu wa kujifungia.

85
00:05:12,694 --> 00:05:14,294
Asante sana.

86
00:05:14,317 --> 00:05:17,895
Mabaki ni shilingi 200.

87
00:05:17,918 --> 00:05:21,724
Asante kwa kutusaidia kupunguza upotevu wa chakula.

88
00:05:21,748 --> 00:05:25,163
Utaonja na kuwa eco-friendly.

89
00:05:25,186 --> 00:05:27,586
Karibu tena.

90
00:05:27,609 --> 00:05:34,714
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

91
00:05:34,714 --> 00:05:36,214
Sehemu ya 3: Kazi ya Kintsugi / Kinywaji cha Kufanya Kintsugi

92
00:05:36,214 --> 00:05:38,261
Samahani.

93
00:05:38,285 --> 00:05:42,552
Tumefika darasani la kufanya kazi ya Kintsugi.

94
00:05:42,575 --> 00:05:44,941
Karibu sana.

95
00:05:44,964 --> 00:05:48,631
Tafadhali kaa kwenye kiti hiki.

96
00:05:48,654 --> 00:05:53,502
Ningependa kukarabati kikombe hiki kilichovunjika ili kiwe safi.

97
00:05:53,526 --> 00:05:59,059
Ndio, unaweza kukarabati kwa urahisi kwa kutumia Kintsugi.

98
00:05:59,082 --> 00:06:03,249
Ni mara yangu ya kwanza, naona wasiwasi kidogo.

99
00:06:03,272 --> 00:06:07,155
Fundi atakufundisha kwa uangalifu.

100
00:06:07,178 --> 00:06:09,468
Ninategemea.

101
00:06:09,492 --> 00:06:14,292
Kwanza, tutaunganisha sehemu zilizovunjika.

102
00:06:14,315 --> 00:06:19,082
Tutaunganisha sehemu hizo kwenye dawati la kazi.

103
00:06:19,105 --> 00:06:22,945
Tutatumia laka asilia maalum.

104
00:06:22,969 --> 00:06:26,444
Je, tutatumia laka ili kuunganisha sehemu hizo?

105
00:06:26,467 --> 00:06:30,234
Ndiyo, tutaunganisha kwa kutumia urushi.

106
00:06:30,257 --> 00:06:32,926
Tutapaka kwa kutumia fimbo ya kupaka.

107
00:06:32,949 --> 00:06:35,716
Tafadhali upake kwenye pengo.

108
00:06:35,739 --> 00:06:38,672
Tutapaka vizuri kwenye pengo.

109
00:06:38,695 --> 00:06:43,373
Kisha, tutasugua uso kwa kutumia karatasi ya kusugua ili kuufanya uwazi.

110
00:06:43,397 --> 00:06:47,531
Tutasugua polepole kwa karatasi ya kusugua.

111
00:06:47,554 --> 00:06:50,687
Uso umekuwa mwangavu.

112
00:06:50,710 --> 00:06:53,524
Mstari wa muunganiko umepatikana.

113
00:06:53,548 --> 00:06:58,081
Mwishowe, tutaweka vumbi la dhahabu halisi.

114
00:06:58,104 --> 00:07:01,152
Tutaweka vumbi la dhahabu.

115
00:07:01,176 --> 00:07:04,509
Tafadhali weke vumbi polepole kwa kutumia fimbo.

116
00:07:04,532 --> 00:07:08,899
Aa, mstari mzuri wa dhahabu umeonekana!

117
00:07:08,922 --> 00:07:12,990
Kazi ya kugandia dhahabu imekuwa nzuri sana.

118
00:07:13,014 --> 00:07:16,820
Ufa uliovunjika umekuwa sanaa.

119
00:07:16,843 --> 00:07:20,135
Hii ni utamaduni wa Kijapani wa kutokuwa na maovu.

120
00:07:20,158 --> 00:07:26,358
Ujumbe wa kutunza vitu unafahamika.

121
00:07:26,381 --> 00:07:29,436
Unaweza kuchukua kikombe kilichosahihishwa nyumbani.

122
00:07:29,460 --> 00:07:32,793
Je, naweza kuchukua leo?

123
00:07:32,816 --> 00:07:37,749
Ndiyo, tutakujaza katika sanduku maalum na kukujulia.

124
00:07:37,772 --> 00:07:40,782
Inachukua siku ngapi kukauka?

125
00:07:40,805 --> 00:07:45,263
Inachukua siku kadhaa ili kukauka kabisa.

126
00:07:45,287 --> 00:07:48,557
Nitakausha nyumbani kwa utunzaji mkubwa.

127
00:07:48,581 --> 00:07:52,853
Usitumie microwave wala mashine ya kufua vyombo.

128
00:07:52,877 --> 00:07:56,488
Ndiyo, nitasafisha kwa mkono polepole.

129
00:07:56,512 --> 00:08:01,761
Tunza kikombe chako kilichosahihishwa kwa mikono yako.

130
00:08:01,785 --> 00:08:05,757
Nimefurahia sana na kupata uzoefu mzuri.

131
00:08:05,780 --> 00:08:10,064
Nafurahi sana kwa kunifurahisha.

132
00:08:10,088 --> 00:08:13,969
Asante kwa kunifundisha kwa uangalifu.

133
00:08:13,993 --> 00:08:16,126
Asante sana.

134
00:08:16,149 --> 00:08:17,649
Sehemu ya 4: Misingi ya Kutafuta Nguo za Kale

135
00:08:17,649 --> 00:08:19,649
Samahani.

136
00:08:19,672 --> 00:08:22,939
Ninatafuta nguo za kale zinazotazama vizuri.

137
00:08:22,962 --> 00:08:25,164
Karibu sana.

138
00:08:25,188 --> 00:08:30,188
Sehemu ya nguo za kike za kale iko ghorofa ya pili.

139
00:08:30,211 --> 00:08:33,377
Tutapanda kwa ngazi hadi ghorofa ya pili.

140
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:37,073
Lifti pia iko nyuma.

141
00:08:37,096 --> 00:08:39,953
Kuna nguo nyingi hapa!

142
00:08:39,977 --> 00:08:43,851
Kuna nguo nyingi za brandi pia.

143
00:08:43,874 --> 00:08:46,612
Ninataka kutafuta gauni.

144
00:08:46,636 --> 00:08:50,569
Gauni zipo kwenye rafu hii.

145
00:08:50,592 --> 00:08:54,559
Gauni hili la buluu ni zuri sana!

146
00:08:54,582 --> 00:08:59,454
Hii ni nguo safi sana kama mpya.

147
00:08:59,477 --> 00:09:01,844
Hali yake ni nzuri.

148
00:09:01,866 --> 00:09:05,666
Hakuna kidonda wala uchafu wowote.

149
00:09:05,689 --> 00:09:08,223
Je, ni saizi ya M?

150
00:09:08,246 --> 00:09:11,579
Ndiyo, ni saizi ya M.

151
00:09:11,602 --> 00:09:14,802
Naweza kujaribu katika chumba cha kujaribia?

152
00:09:14,825 --> 00:09:19,402
Ndiyo, jaribu katika chumba cha kujaribia hiki.

153
00:09:19,426 --> 00:09:22,124
Nitavua viatu ili kuingia.

154
00:09:22,147 --> 00:09:24,349
Kuna kioo cha kujitazama pia.

155
00:09:24,373 --> 00:09:26,976
Vipi?

156
00:09:26,999 --> 00:09:29,399
Saizi inafaa kabisa.

157
00:09:29,422 --> 00:09:31,856
Inaonekana vizuri sana kwako.

158
00:09:31,879 --> 00:09:33,963
Bei ni ngapi?

159
00:09:33,987 --> 00:09:38,606
Ni nusu ya bei ya kawaida, ni shilingi elfu mbili na mia tano (2500).

160
00:09:38,630 --> 00:09:42,236
Shilingi elfu mbili na mia tano (2500) ni bei nzuri sana.

161
00:09:42,260 --> 00:09:46,935
Kwa sababu ni duka la bidhaa zilizotumika tena, unaweza kununua bei nafuu.

162
00:09:46,958 --> 00:09:50,025
Ningependa kutafuta jaketi pia.

163
00:09:50,049 --> 00:09:53,316
Hapa kuna jaketi nyeusi.

164
00:09:53,340 --> 00:09:56,306
Kitambaa chake ni imara sana.

165
00:09:56,329 --> 00:09:59,013
Hii ni jaketi ya chapa maarufu.

166
00:09:59,037 --> 00:10:01,711
Jaketi ni bei gani?

167
00:10:01,734 --> 00:10:05,191
Jaketi ni shilingi elfu tatu (3000).

168
00:10:05,215 --> 00:10:08,293
Nitainunua gauni na jaketi.

169
00:10:08,317 --> 00:10:12,012
Jumla ni shilingi elfu tano na mia tano (5500).

170
00:10:12,035 --> 00:10:16,268
Kama nitaonyesha pasipoti, nitaweza kupata kodi ya kutozwa?

171
00:10:16,291 --> 00:10:20,491
Ndiyo, kama utaonyesha pasipoti, utapata kodi ya kutozwa.

172
00:10:20,514 --> 00:10:23,186
Nitaonyesha pasipoti yangu.

173
00:10:23,209 --> 00:10:25,142
Asante sana.

174
00:10:25,165 --> 00:10:27,899
Tutakupunguzia bei hadi shilingi elfu tano (5000).

175
00:10:27,922 --> 00:10:30,939
Nitamlipa kwa kadi ya mkopo.

176
00:10:30,962 --> 00:10:33,054
Tutakushika kadi yako.

177
00:10:33,078 --> 00:10:35,878
Malipo yamekamilika.

178
00:10:35,901 --> 00:10:37,434
Asante sana.

179
00:10:37,457 --> 00:10:39,824
Karibu tena.

180
00:10:39,847 --> 00:10:41,347
Sehemu ya 5: Jinsi ya kuchagua chupa ya kunywa tena / Jinsi ya kuchagua chupa endelevu

181
00:10:41,347 --> 00:10:43,547
Samahani.

182
00:10:43,570 --> 00:10:46,416
Ninatafuta chupa ya kunywa tena.

183
00:10:46,439 --> 00:10:48,283
Karibu sana.

184
00:10:48,306 --> 00:10:52,800
Hapa kuna chupa za felezi.

185
00:10:52,823 --> 00:10:56,116
Je, naweza kuiutumia mara kwa mara?

186
