189
00:11:04,914 --> 00:11:06,447
Ndiyo.

190
00:11:06,470 --> 00:11:10,245
Unaweza kuweka maji baridi ndani.

191
00:11:10,269 --> 00:11:13,469
Je, chai moto pia inawezekana?

192
00:11:13,492 --> 00:11:16,659
Ina uwezo wa kutunza joto.

193
00:11:16,682 --> 00:11:19,571
Chai moto pia inawezekana.

194
00:11:19,594 --> 00:11:22,848
Ina nafasi ya kiasi gani?

195
00:11:22,871 --> 00:11:26,071
Ina nafasi ya mililita mia tano (500ml).

196
00:11:26,094 --> 00:11:28,583
Ukubwa wake ni sawa tu.

197
00:11:28,606 --> 00:11:32,046
Ni nyepesi na nzuri sana.

198
00:11:32,070 --> 00:11:34,324
Je, ina rangi zipi?

199
00:11:34,347 --> 00:11:38,280
Ina rangi nyeupe, nyeusi na pinki.

200
00:11:38,303 --> 00:11:41,437
Nionyeshe chupa nyeupe tafadhali.

201
00:11:41,460 --> 00:11:42,993
Ndiyo.

202
00:11:43,016 --> 00:11:45,633
Hii ni nyeupe.

203
00:11:45,656 --> 00:11:49,023
Muundo wake ni rahisi na mzuri.

204
00:11:49,046 --> 00:11:51,979
Ni rahisi kusafisha pia.

205
00:11:52,002 --> 00:11:54,847
Je, naweza kutoa kifuniko na kusafisha?

206
