Ndiyo.

207
00:11:56,535 --> 00:11:59,580
Tafadhali toa kifuniko na usafishe.

208
00:11:59,603 --> 00:12:03,262
Je, naweza kujaza maji mjini?

209
00:12:03,285 --> 00:12:04,729
Ndiyo.

210
00:12:04,752 --> 00:12:08,552
Kuna vituo vya kujaza maji bila malipo.

211
00:12:08,575 --> 00:12:11,511
Hii itapunguza matumizi ya chupa za plastiki.

212
00:12:11,534 --> 00:12:14,968
Unaweza kupunguza takataka za plastiki.

213
00:12:14,992 --> 00:12:17,434
Bei ni ngapi?

214
00:12:17,457 --> 00:12:21,657
Jumla ikiwa ni pamoja na kodi ni shilingi elfu mbili na mia mbili (2200).

215
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:24,913
Nitainunua chupa nyeupe hii.

216
00:12:24,936 --> 00:12:26,870
Asante sana.

217
