Je, inaweza kuwekwa ndani ya sanduku?

218
00:12:30,149 --> 00:12:34,282
Tutakua tunaziweka ndani ya sanduku na kupambwa na riboni.

219
00:12:34,305 --> 00:12:36,924
Tafadhali pambie kama zawadi.

220
00:12:36,948 --> 00:12:38,481
Ndiyo.

221
00:12:38,504 --> 00:12:41,105
Tutakupamba vizuri kwa ajili yako.

222
00:12:41,129 --> 00:12:43,929
Nitamlipa kwa kadi ya mkopo.

223
00:12:43,951 --> 00:12:48,151
Tafadhali pigia kadi yako kwenye kifaa hiki.

224
00:12:48,174 --> 00:12:49,608
Ndiyo.

225
00:12:49,631 --> 00:12:51,397
Nitapiga kadi yangu.

226
00:12:51,421 --> 00:12:54,554
Tutakurudishia risiti na kadi yako.

227
00:12:54,577 --> 00:12:58,144
Tutaiweka chupa yako ndani ya mfuko.

228
00:12:58,167 --> 00:13:00,016
Asante sana.

229
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:03,573
Asante kwa kunieleza kwa uangalifu.

230
00:13:03,596 --> 00:13:05,649
Asante sana.

231
00:13:05,672 --> 00:13:07,172
Sehemu ya 6: Habari Mpya Kuhusu Kupunguza Kodi ya Chakula Nchini Japani

232
00:13:07,172 --> 00:13:10,806
Umeangalia habari za asubuhi?

233
00:13:10,829 --> 00:13:13,704
Hapana, sijawaona.

234
00:13:13,727 --> 00:13:18,421
Hii ni habari kuhusu kupunguza kodi ya chakula nchini Japani.

235
00:13:18,445 --> 00:13:21,251
Kupunguza kodi ya chakula?

236
00:13:21,274 --> 00:13:23,641
Ni habari gani?

237
00:13:23,664 --> 00:13:28,321
Kodi ya chakula itapungua.

238
00:13:28,344 --> 00:13:32,077
Ni furaha kusikia kwamba kodi inapungua.

239
00:13:32,100 --> 00:13:38,067
Kodi ya chakula na vinywaji itakuwa asilimia moja tu.

240
00:13:38,090 --> 00:13:40,690
Asilimia moja?

241
00:13:40,713 --> 00:13:43,385
Ni rahisi sana!

242
00:13:43,408 --> 00:13:48,175
Vitu vitakuwa rahisi na hii ni msaada mkubwa.

243
00:13:48,198 --> 00:13:51,531
Je, wageni pia wataweza kununua bei nafuu?

244
00:13:51,554 --> 00:13:55,888
Ndiyo, kila mtu atanunua bei nafuu.

245
00:13:55,911 --> 00:13:59,919
Ninangojea kwa hamu kwenda kununua bidhaa katika duka la rejareja.

246
00:13:59,942 --> 00:14:03,509
Chakula cha bei nafuu na bora kinaenea haraka.

247
00:14:03,532 --> 00:14:06,899
Chakula cha bei nafuu na bora ni nini?

248
00:14:06,922 --> 00:14:10,931
Ni chakula cha bei nafuu na kitamu.

249
00:14:10,954 --> 00:14:14,045
Kuna aina gani za chakula?

250
00:14:14,069 --> 00:14:18,035
Mlo wa jioni katika duka la rejareja huwa na bei nafuu.

251
00:14:18,058 --> 00:14:24,354
Jioni bei hupungua. Kuna stika za punguzo.

252
00:14:24,378 --> 00:14:28,017
Unaweza kununua mlo wa nusu bei.

253
00:14:28,041 --> 00:14:31,374
Chakula cha duka la rejareja katika maduka makubwa pia ni bei nafuu.

254
00:14:31,397 --> 00:14:35,364
Kuna maduka mengi ya vyakula kitamu.

255
00:14:35,387 --> 00:14:39,154
Korokke katika njia ya maduka pia ni tamu sana.

256
00:14:39,177 --> 00:14:42,710
Je, naweza kununua moja kwa shilingi mia moja?

257
00:14:42,733 --> 00:14:47,133
Ndiyo, unaweza kununua moja kwa shilingi mia moja.

258
00:14:47,156 --> 00:14:51,004
Nitafuta maduka ya chakula cha bei nafuu na kitamu.

259
00:14:51,027 --> 00:14:55,126
Tukale chakula cha bei nafuu pamoja.

260
00:14:55,150 --> 00:14:58,008
Je, leo tutakwenda dukani jioni?

261
00:14:58,032 --> 00:15:02,504
Ndiyo, tutakwenda dukani saa moja usiku.

262
00:15:02,527 --> 00:15:06,060
Tutatafuta mlo wa nusu bei.

263
00:15:06,083 --> 00:15:09,017
Tutanunua pia sushi iliyopunguzwa bei.

264
00:15:09,040 --> 00:15:12,173
Tutaonana hoteli saa moja usiku.

265
00:15:12,196 --> 00:15:16,168
Tuchague sushi tamu.

266
00:15:16,192 --> 00:15:19,242
Asante kwa kunisaidia habari.

267
00:15:19,265 --> 00:15:22,147
Tununue kwa bei nzuri.

268
00:15:22,171 --> 00:15:25,008
Ndiyo, ninafurahi sana.

269
00:15:25,032 --> 00:15:27,565
Basi tutaonana baadaye.

270
00:15:27,588 --> 00:15:29,088
Sehemu ya 7: Jinsi ya Kuelewa Stika za Punguzo

271
00:15:29,088 --> 00:15:30,965
Samahani.

272
00:15:30,989 --> 00:15:34,286
Sehemu ya mlo wa chakula iko wapi?

273
00:15:34,309 --> 00:15:36,309
Karibu sana.

274
00:15:36,332 --> 00:15:39,934
Iko upande wa kulia nyuma.

275
00:15:39,958 --> 00:15:43,562
Kuna mlo wa chakula mingi uliosawazishwa.

276
00:15:43,585 --> 00:15:47,952
Kwa sababu ni saa moja usiku, tutalaza stika za punguzo.

277
00:15:47,975 --> 00:15:50,951
Aha, stika zimewekwa sasa.

278
00:15:50,974 --> 00:15:52,374
Ndiyo.

279
00:15:52,397 --> 00:15:56,416
Stika ya njano inatoa punguzo la asilimia thelathini.

280
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:59,773
Inapungua bei kwa asilimia thelathini?

281
00:15:59,796 --> 00:16:01,196
Ndiyo.

282
00:16:01,219 --> 00:16:05,086
Unaweza kununua kwa bei iliyopungua asilimia thelathini.

283
00:16:05,109 --> 00:16:08,361
Stika nyekundu ni nini?

284
00:16:08,384 --> 00:16:12,318
Stika nyekundu inapunguza bei kwa nusu.

285
00:16:12,341 --> 00:16:15,107
Hii ni punguzo la asilimia hamsini, sawa?

286
00:16:15,130 --> 00:16:17,145
Hii ni nzuri sana!

287
00:16:17,169 --> 00:16:20,769
Mlo wa tonkatsu uliopo hapa una bei ya nusu.

288
00:16:20,792 --> 00:16:23,434
Bei ya awali ni pesa ngapi?

289
00:16:23,457 --> 00:16:27,591
Bei ya awali ni shilingi mia sita.

290
00:16:27,614 --> 00:16:30,861
Kwa nusu bei, basi ni shilingi mia tatu, sawa?

291
00:16:30,884 --> 00:16:32,553
Ndiyo.

292
00:16:32,576 --> 00:16:35,452
Unaweza kununua kwa shilingi mia tatu tu.

293
00:16:35,476 --> 00:16:38,642
Je, kuna mlo wa Makunouchi pia?

294
00:16:38,665 --> 00:16:40,399
Ndiyo.

295
00:16:40,422 --> 00:16:44,755
Mlo wa Makunouchi pia tutalitia stika ya nusu bei.

296
00:16:44,778 --> 00:16:47,516
Una samaki wa samoni na tenpura ndani yake.

297
00:16:47,540 --> 00:16:50,273
Hii ni mlo wa kifahari sana!

298
00:16:50,296 --> 00:16:54,498
Nitanunua mlo wa tonkatsu na ule wa Makunouchi.

299
00:16:54,521 --> 00:16:57,388
Kwa mbili, bei itakuwa shilingi mia sita, sawa?

300
00:16:57,411 --> 00:17:00,219
Je, chai pia inapungua bei?

301
00:17:00,242 --> 00:17:04,280
Chai pia inapungua bei kwa asilimia ishirini.

302
00:17:04,304 --> 00:17:07,275
Nitapata chai moja pia.

303
00:17:07,298 --> 00:17:10,341
Chai itakuwa shilingi themanini.

304
00:17:10,364 --> 00:17:14,098
Tafadhali hesabu jumla.

305
00:17:14,121 --> 00:17:18,854
Mlo mbili na chai, jumla ni shilingi mia sita themanini.

306
00:17:18,877 --> 00:17:22,447
Nitakupa noti ya elfu moja.

307
00:17:22,471 --> 00:17:24,871
Tumepewa noti ya elfu moja.

308
00:17:24,894 --> 00:17:28,165
Mali ya kurudishiwa ni shilingi mia tatu ishirini.

309
00:17:28,188 --> 00:17:31,321
Nimepokea risiti na pesa ya mchango.

310
00:17:31,344 --> 00:17:34,477
Nitakujaza vijiko viwili.

311
00:17:34,500 --> 00:17:37,434
Asante kwa kujaza vijiko, unisaidia sana.

312
00:17:37,457 --> 00:17:41,127
Ukikipika kwa oveni, utakuwa mtamu zaidi!

313
00:17:41,150 --> 00:17:45,323
Nitapika kwa oveni iliyo chumbani kwangu.

314
00:17:45,346 --> 00:17:46,795
Asante sana.

315
00:17:46,819 --> 00:17:49,396
Karibu tena.

316
00:17:49,419 --> 00:17:50,919
Sehemu ya 8: Vyakula Maarufu vya Mitaani katika Ghala la Soko la Department Store

317
00:17:50,919 --> 00:17:52,986
Samahani.

318
00:17:53,010 --> 00:17:57,621
Nimekuja kununua vyakula maarufu vya mitaani.

319
00:17:57,644 --> 00:17:59,698
Karibu sana.

320
00:17:59,722 --> 00:18:02,813
Karibu katika ghala la chini la soko la department store.

321
00:18:02,836 --> 00:18:06,770
Ni chakula gani cha mitaani kinachoongoza kwa umaarufu?

322
00:18:06,793 --> 00:18:11,261
Huu ni chili ya kamba inayopendwa sana.

323
00:18:11,284 --> 00:18:13,617
Chili ya kamba, sawa?

324
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:16,507
Inaonekana kuwa tamu sana!

325
00:18:16,530 --> 00:18:20,463
Kuna kamba kubwa na tamu ndani yake.

326
00:18:20,486 --> 00:18:25,583
Je, naweza kununua kwa kuzingatia uzito?

327
00:18:25,606 --> 00:18:30,482
Ndiyo, unaweza kununua kwa kila gramu mia moja.

328
00:18:30,506 --> 00:18:33,563
Gramu mia moja ni bei gani?

329
00:18:33,586 --> 00:18:37,453
Gramu mia moja ni shilingi mia nne.

330
00:18:37,476 --> 00:18:40,111
Nipatie gramu mia mbili.

331
00:18:40,134 --> 00:18:42,668
Gramu mia mbili, sawa.

332
00:18:42,691 --> 00:18:46,383
Nitakujaza kwenye pakiti maalum.

333
00:18:46,406 --> 00:18:49,460
Je, kuna saladi ya viazi pia?

334
00:18:49,484 --> 00:18:54,324
Ndiyo, tuna saladi ya viazi iliyotengenezwa nyumbani.

335
00:18:54,348 --> 00:18:58,714
Nipatie saladi ya viazi kwa gramu mia moja pia.

336
00:18:58,737 --> 00:19:03,504
Saladi ya viazi ni shilingi mia mbili kwa gramu mia moja.

337
00:19:03,527 --> 00:19:07,385
Unaweza kunipachika kwenye pakiti safi?

338
00:19:07,409 --> 00:19:11,383
Nitakujaza kwenye pakiti safi maalum.

339
00:19:11,406 --> 00:19:14,782
Nitachukua nje kwa takeaway.

340
00:19:14,805 --> 00:19:19,939
Ndiyo, nitakujaza kwenye mfuko wa kubeba.

341
00:19:19,963 --> 00:19:22,815
Je, ni afadhali nikale leo hii?

342
00:19:22,838 --> 00:19:26,255
Tafadhali kula leo hii.

343
00:19:26,278 --> 00:19:30,512
Nitakula chakula cha usiku chumbani kwangu kwenye hoteli.

344
00:19:30,535 --> 00:19:33,268
Je, unahitaji baridi ya kulinda?

345
00:19:33,291 --> 00:19:36,624
Ndiyo, tafadhali nitumie baridi ya kulinda.

346
00:19:36,647 --> 00:19:40,581
Nitakujaza baridi ya kulinda moja bure.

347
00:19:40,604 --> 00:19:43,684
Asante sana.

348
00:19:43,707 --> 00:19:46,873
Asante sana.

349
00:19:46,896 --> 00:19:51,131
Jumla ni shilingi elfu moja.

350
00:19:51,155 --> 00:19:54,722
Je, naweza kulipa kwa kadi ya mkopo?

351
00:19:54,745 --> 00:19:59,778
Ndiyo, unaweza kulipa kwa kadi ya mkopo.

352
00:19:59,801 --> 00:20:02,814
Nitakulipa kwa kugusa.

353
00:20:02,837 --> 00:20:06,170
Tafadhali gusa kwenye kifaa hiki.

354
00:20:06,193 --> 00:20:08,393
Nimegusa.

355
00:20:08,416 --> 00:20:11,250
Malipo yamekamilika.

356
00:20:11,273 --> 00:20:16,006
Nitakupa mfuko wa chakula cha nyumbani.

357
00:20:16,029 --> 00:20:19,608
Asante kwa kunipachika kwa uangalifu.

358
00:20:19,631 --> 00:20:23,688
Tafadhali furahia chakula cha nyumbani kitamu.

359
00:20:23,711 --> 00:20:26,245
Asante sana.

360
00:20:26,268 --> 00:20:28,834
Karibu tena.

361
00:20:28,857 --> 00:20:30,357
Sehemu ya 9: Ununuzi wa Korokke na Menchi Katsu

362
00:20:30,357 --> 00:20:32,357
Samahani.

363
00:20:32,380 --> 00:20:35,714
Je, naweza kununua korokke?

364
00:20:35,737 --> 00:20:38,350
Karibu sana.

365
00:20:38,373 --> 00:20:42,014
Ndiyo, tuna korokke tamu sana.

366
00:20:42,038 --> 00:20:44,671
Je, zimekaanga sasa hivi?

367
00:20:44,694 --> 00:20:48,694
Ndiyo, zimekaanga sasa hivi.

368
00:20:48,717 --> 00:20:52,010
Nataka korokke moto.

369
00:20:52,033 --> 00:20:55,800
Nitakupa korokke moto mno.

370
00:20:55,823 --> 00:20:58,356
Moja ni bei gani?

371
00:20:58,379 --> 00:21:02,456
Moja ni shilingi 120.

372
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:04,480
Nitununua mbili.

373
00:21:04,503 --> 00:21:10,870
Mbili ni shilingi 240. Je, una menchi katsu pia?

374
00:21:10,892 --> 00:21:14,961
Ndiyo, tuna menchi katsu ya nyama ya ng'ombe.

375
00:21:14,985 --> 00:21:17,918
Menchi katsu ni bei gani?

376
00:21:17,941 --> 00:21:22,385
Menchi katsu ni shilingi 180 kwa moja.

377
00:21:22,408 --> 00:21:25,026
Nitununue menchi katsu moja pia.

378
00:21:25,050 --> 00:21:29,650
Jumla ni shilingi 420.

379
00:21:29,673 --> 00:21:33,406
Je, unaweza kunizika kwenye mfuko wa karatasi?

380
00:21:33,429 --> 00:21:36,965
Ndiyo, nitakujaza kwenye mfuko wa karatasi.

381
00:21:36,989 --> 00:21:40,522
Je, naweza kula hapa sasa?

382
00:21:40,545 --> 00:21:44,884
Unaweza kula kwenye benchi mbele ya duka.

383
00:21:44,907 --> 00:21:47,274
Nitakula kwenye benchi.

384
00:21:47,297 --> 00:21:49,430
Je, unataka mchuzi?

385
00:21:49,453 --> 00:21:52,140
Ndiyo, tafadhali weka mchuzi.

386
00:21:52,164 --> 00:21:54,997
Nimeweka mchuzi maalum.

387
00:21:55,020 --> 00:21:58,079
Zina tabia ya kuvunja na ni tamu mno.

388
00:21:58,102 --> 00:22:01,636
Hizi ni korokke za nyumbani kutoka kwa mchuuzi wa nyama.

389
00:22:01,659 --> 00:22:05,351
Ndani ya viazi vina tabia ya kuvunjika.

390
00:22:05,375 --> 00:22:07,980
Zilizoandaliwa sasa ni tamu mno.

391
00:22:08,003 --> 00:22:11,370
Nitakulipa kwa sarafu ya shilingi 500.

392
00:22:11,393 --> 00:22:14,968
Tutakupokea shilingi 500.

393
00:22:14,992 --> 00:22:18,525
Nitakurudishia shilingi 80.

394
00:22:18,548 --> 00:22:20,846
Umepokea pesa ya mchango.

395
00:22:20,870 --> 00:22:24,744
Tako la takataka liko karibu na benchi.

396
00:22:24,768 --> 00:22:28,339
Nitachukua karatasi na kutupa kwenye tako la takataka.

397
00:22:28,362 --> 00:22:31,208
Furahia kutembea na kula stesheni hii!

398
00:22:31,232 --> 00:22:34,449
Asante kwa korokke tamu sana!

399
00:22:34,473 --> 00:22:36,939
Asante sana.

400
00:22:36,962 --> 00:22:39,533
Karibu tena!

401
00:22:39,556 --> 00:22:41,056
Sehemu ya 10: Tofauti za Kiwango cha Kodi / Tofauti za Kodi: Kula Ndani au Kuchukua Nje

402
00:22:41,056 --> 00:22:42,856
Samahani.

403
00:22:42,879 --> 00:22:46,213
Ninunua onigiri na kafe latte.

404
00:22:46,236 --> 00:22:47,870
Karibu sana.

405
00:22:47,893 --> 00:22:50,730
Tutakuhesabu sasa.

406
00:22:50,753 --> 00:22:54,486
Nitakula ndani ya duka hapa.

407
00:22:54,509 --> 00:22:57,044
Unautumia eneo la kula ndani, sawa?

408
00:22:57,068 --> 00:22:59,938
Je, kodi itabadilika?

409
00:22:59,962 --> 00:23:01,495
Ndiyo,

410
00:23:01,518 --> 00:23:05,534
Kula ndani kunalipa kodi ya asilimia 10.

411
00:23:05,557 --> 00:23:08,571
Kama nitaichukua nje, ni bei gani?

412
00:23:08,594 --> 00:23:13,462
Kuchukua nje kunalipa kodi ya asilimia 8 kwa kipimo cha kodi iliyopunguzwa.

413
00:23:13,486 --> 00:23:17,101
Kodi inatofautiana kwa asilimia 2.

414
00:23:17,124 --> 00:23:18,524
Ndiyo,

415
00:23:18,547 --> 00:23:22,719
Kula ndani kunalipa kodi ya asilimia 10.

416
00:23:22,742 --> 00:23:24,542
Nimeelewa.

417
00:23:24,566 --> 00:23:27,366
Nitakula ndani.

418
00:23:27,389 --> 00:23:32,155
Basi, tutahesabu kwa kiwango cha kodi ya asilimia 10.

419
00:23:32,178 --> 00:23:36,423
Jumla ya malipo ni shilingi 550.

420
00:23:36,446 --> 00:23:40,980
Nitilipa kwa kadi ya IC ya usafiri.

421
00:23:41,003 --> 00:23:43,403
Tafadhali pigia hapa.

422
00:23:43,426 --> 00:23:46,113
Malipo yamekamilika.

423
00:23:46,136 --> 00:23:50,144
Je, naweza kupata onigiri yangu ikainuliwa joto?

424
00:23:50,167 --> 00:23:51,737
Ndiyo,

425
00:23:51,760 --> 00:23:54,227
Tutainua kwa microwave.

426
00:23:54,250 --> 00:23:58,147
Napenda kula onigiri moto.

427
00:23:58,171 --> 00:24:01,337
Tumeinua kwa microwave kwa sekunde 15.

428
00:24:01,360 --> 00:24:04,694
Nitachukua kikombe cha kafe latte.

429
00:24:04,717 --> 00:24:06,126
Ndiyo,

430
00:24:06,149 --> 00:24:09,682
Hiki ni kikombe kikubwa, karibu.

431
00:24:09,705 --> 00:24:13,672
Tafadhali bonyeza kitufe cha kafe latte kwenye mashine ya kahawa.

432
00:24:13,695 --> 00:24:15,568
Sawa.

433
00:24:15,591 --> 00:24:18,758
Utaipata kafe latte tamu sana!

434
00:24:18,781 --> 00:24:22,453
Eneo la kula ndani lina vituo vya umeme pia.

435
00:24:22,476 --> 00:24:25,613
Chagua kiti unachokipenda na kukalia.

436
00:24:25,636 --> 00:24:28,403
Ni vizuri kuwa na nafasi ya kupakia simu.

437
00:24:28,426 --> 00:24:32,277
Unaweza kutumia Wi-Fi bure pia.

438
00:24:32,300 --> 00:24:35,533
Nitaketi na kula polepole.

439
00:24:35,556 --> 00:24:40,123
Tafadhali tupa takataka kwenye tako karibu na eneo la kula ndani.

440
00:24:40,146 --> 00:24:42,226
Kaa na kufurahia chakula chako.

441
