00:36:45,652 --> 00:36:51,285
Unaweza kukodisha baiskeli ya umeme.

664
00:36:51,308 --> 00:36:55,741
Baiskeli ya umeme inafanya milima iwe rahisi.

665
00:36:55,765 --> 00:37:00,773
Ina umaarufu katika njia ya Shimanami na Kyoto.

666
00:37:00,796 --> 00:37:04,405
Kuhisi upepo ni nzuri sana.

667
00:37:04,429 --> 00:37:08,288
Kuna njia maalum kwa ajili ya baiskeli.

668
00:37:08,311 --> 00:37:12,045
Unaweza kupanda salama.

669
00:37:12,068 --> 00:37:16,038
Unaweza kukodisha katika ofisi ya utalii.

670
00:37:16,061 --> 00:37:21,040
Je, naweza kuiacha baiskeli mahali pengine?

671
00:37:21,063 --> 00:37:24,939
Unaweza kuirudisha katika kituo kingine.

672
00:37:24,962 --> 00:37:28,096
Hiyo ni rahisi sana.

673
00:37:28,119 --> 00:37:32,685
Unaweza kukodisha helmeti bure.

674
00:37:32,708 --> 00:37:35,846
Usalama umewekwa vizuri.

675
00:37:35,869 --> 00:37:40,803
Unaweza kukodisha kwa takriban shilingi 1500 kwa siku.

676
00:37:40,826 --> 00:37:45,099
Unaweza kufurahia kwa bei nafuu.

677
00:37:45,122 --> 00:37:47,997
Leo nataka kupanda baiskeli.

678
00:37:48,020 --> 00:37:52,420
Twende ofisi ya utalii kukodisha baiskeli.

679
00:37:52,443 --> 00:37:56,510
Unaweza kufanya uhifadhi wa mtandaoni pia.

680
00:37:56,533 --> 00:38:00,111
Kuhifadhi nafasi kunakupa amani ya akili.

681
00:38:00,135 --> 00:38:03,501
Nitapiga ombi mtandaoni sasa hivi.

682
00:38:03,524 --> 00:38:07,604
Tupande njia yenye mandhari nzuri.

683
00:38:07,628 --> 00:38:10,994
Nataka kupanda njia ya pwani.

684
00:38:11,017 --> 00:38:15,695
Tutakula aiskrimu tamu katika kituo cha barabarani.

685
00:38:15,719 --> 00:38:19,285
Itakuwa safari ya baiskeli bora kabisa!

686
00:38:19,308 --> 00:38:22,275
Tutakataza mizigo ndani ya begi la mgongo.

687
00:38:22,298 --> 00:38:25,531
Acha tuvike nguo zinazoruhusu mwendo rahisi.

688
00:38:25,554 --> 00:38:28,600
Nitavaa viatu vya michezo.

689
00:38:28,624 --> 00:38:32,661
Tuchukue maji kwa ajili ya kunywa pia.

690
00:38:32,684 --> 00:38:35,654
Tayari kila kitu kimeandaliwa vizuri.

691
00:38:35,677 --> 00:38:39,880
Endelea kwa usalama na furahia safari.

692
00:38:39,904 --> 00:38:43,998
Asante kwa kunisaidia habari.

693
00:38:44,021 --> 00:38:48,088
Tutakagua baiskeli tayari na kuondoka.

694
00:38:48,111 --> 00:38:50,724
Ndiyo, ninafurahia sana!

695
00:38:50,747 --> 00:38:52,247
Sehemu ya 17: Jinsi ya Kukodisha Baiskeli / How to Rent a Bicycle

696
00:38:52,247 --> 00:38:54,665
Samahani.

697
00:38:54,689 --> 00:38:58,689
Ningependa kukodisha baiskeli.

698
00:38:58,711 --> 00:39:00,716
Karibu sana.

699
00:39:00,740 --> 00:39:05,986
Tuna baiskeli za umeme (E-bike).

700
00:39:06,009 --> 00:39:09,776
Je, naweza kukodisha E-bike?

701
00:39:09,799 --> 00:39:13,844
Ndiyo, unaweza kukodisha.

702
00:39:13,867 --> 00:39:17,434
Bei ya siku moja ni kiasi gani?

703
00:39:17,457 --> 00:39:21,635
Bei ni yenye shilingi elfu moja na mia tano kwa siku moja.

704
00:39:21,658 --> 00:39:24,425
Shilingi elfu moja na mia tano, sawa.

705
00:39:24,448 --> 00:39:29,615
Je, utarejesha kabla ya saa kumi na saba jioni?

706
00:39:29,638 --> 00:39:33,708
Ndiyo, tafadhali urejeshe kabla ya saa kumi na saba jioni.

707
00:39:33,731 --> 00:39:37,464
Nitaandika fomu ya maombi.

708
00:39:37,487 --> 00:39:42,054
Tafadhali jaza jina lako na nambari ya simu kwenye fomu.

709
00:39:42,077 --> 00:39:45,010
Nimejaza fomu.

710
00:39:45,033 --> 00:39:48,836
Tafadhali nionyeshe kitambulisho chako.

711
00:39:48,860 --> 00:39:51,515
Nitakupatia pasipoti yangu.

712
00:39:51,538 --> 00:39:54,705
Uthibitisho wa pasipoti umekamilika.

713
00:39:54,728 --> 00:39:58,295
Nitakulipa kwa pesa taslimu.

714
00:39:58,318 --> 00:40:02,087
Tunapokea shilingi elfu moja na mia tano.

715
00:40:02,110 --> 00:40:06,177
Tutakupatia ufunguo wa baiskeli na risiti.

716
00:40:06,200 --> 00:40:07,733
Asante sana.

717
00:40:07,756 --> 00:40:11,090
Tumetayarisha baiskeli nje.

718
00:40:11,113 --> 00:40:14,601
Je, betri imeshakuzwa kikamilifu?

719
00:40:14,624 --> 00:40:19,101
Ndiyo, imeshakuzwa asilimia mia moja.

720
00:40:19,124 --> 00:40:22,924
Tafadhali niwafundishe jinsi ya kuwashia umeme.

721
00:40:22,947 --> 00:40:26,681
Bonyeza kitufe kwa muda mrefu.

722
00:40:26,704 --> 00:40:31,306
Baada ya kubonyeza kitufe, taa na kipimio vimewashwa.

723
00:40:31,330 --> 00:40:36,163
Kwenye milima, badilisha kwenye hali ya nguvu zaidi.

724
00:40:36,186 --> 00:40:39,923
Hata milimani utapanda kwa urahisi.

725
00:40:39,947 --> 00:40:44,613
Usalama kwanza, tafadhali vaa helmeti.

726
00:40:44,636 --> 00:40:47,270
Nimeelewa.

727
00:40:47,293 --> 00:40:51,628
Tutakupatia ramani ya baiskeli inayopendekezwa.

728
00:40:51,651 --> 00:40:54,584
Nimepokea ramani ya utalii.

729
00:40:54,607 --> 00:40:57,941
Tutapanda njia yenye mandhari nzuri.

730
00:40:57,964 --> 00:41:01,842
Tafadhali panda upande wa kushoto wa barabara.

731
00:41:01,866 --> 00:41:04,753
Nitapanda kwa tahadhari na kuangalia magari.

732
00:41:04,776 --> 00:41:09,417
Taa huzungushwa moja kwa moja wakati giza.

733
00:41:09,441 --> 00:41:12,445
Taa zinazowashwa moja kwa moja ni salama sana.

734
00:41:12,468 --> 00:41:15,638
Angalia usalama na uende salama.

735
00:41:15,662 --> 00:41:19,329
Asante kwa maelezo ya kina.

736
00:41:19,352 --> 00:41:21,637
Asante sana.

737
00:41:21,660 --> 00:41:23,160
Sehemu ya 18: Kupima Ukubwa wa Helmeti / Helmet Size Adjustment

738
00:41:23,160 --> 00:41:25,593
Samahani.

739
00:41:25,616 --> 00:41:29,434
Ningependa kupima ukubwa wa helmeti yangu.

740
00:41:29,457 --> 00:41:31,124
Karibu sana.

741
00:41:31,147 --> 00:41:35,033
Tafadhali vaa helmeti hii.

742
00:41:35,056 --> 00:41:38,751
Nitavaa helmeti ya ukubwa wa wastani (M).

743
00:41:38,774 --> 00:41:42,041
Je, inakufaa kwa ukubwa wa kichwa chako?

744
00:41:42,065 --> 00:41:45,721
Inaonekana kuwa upana wa pembeni unatosha kidogo.

745
00:41:45,745 --> 00:41:50,318
Basi, nitakuletea helmeti ya ukubwa L.

746
00:41:50,341 --> 00:41:52,819
Nitajaribu helmeti ya ukubwa L.

747
00:41:52,843 --> 00:41:55,409
Helmeti ya ukubwa L inafaa?

748
00:41:55,432 --> 00:41:59,076
Helmeti ya ukubwa L inafaa vizuri na haumzi.

749
00:41:59,100 --> 00:42:03,933
Tafadhali zungusha adjasta ya nyuma.

750
00:42:03,957 --> 00:42:07,199
Nitazungusha dial kwa upande wa kulia.

751
00:42:07,223 --> 00:42:10,256
Imefika vizuri kwenye kichwa chako.

752
00:42:10,279 --> 00:42:14,212
Je, ungependa kukarabati urefu wa kamba ya kidevu?

753
00:42:14,235 --> 00:42:15,604
Ndiyo.

754
00:42:15,628 --> 00:42:20,324
Fanya urefu wa kamba iwe na nafasi ya kidole kimoja chini ya kidevu.

755
00:42:20,347 --> 00:42:23,114
Nitakaza buckle.

756
00:42:23,137 --> 00:42:25,419
Je, inacheza?

757
00:42:25,443 --> 00:42:28,134
Hata nikikunguruke kichwa, haizui.

758
00:42:28,157 --> 00:42:31,563
Umepata ukubwa unaofaa kwa usahihi.

759
00:42:31,586 --> 00:42:36,801
Je, nchini Japani, ni lazima kuvaa helmeti wakati wa kuendesha baiskeli?

760
00:42:36,825 --> 00:42:38,158
Ndiyo.

761
00:42:38,181 --> 00:42:42,648
Kuvvaa helmeti ni wajibu wa juhudi.

762
00:42:42,672 --> 00:42:46,805
Usalama kwanza, nitavaa helmeti wakati wa kuendesha.

763
00:42:46,828 --> 00:42:47,995
Ndiyo.

764
00:42:48,018 --> 00:42:52,151
Inakinga kichwa wakati wa kuanguka kwa bahati mbaya.

765
00:42:52,174 --> 00:42:55,553
Helmeti inagharimu pesa ngapi kwa kukodisha?

766
00:42:55,576 --> 00:42:58,949
Helmeti ni bure.

767
00:42:58,972 --> 00:43:02,806
Nafurahi sana kuwa naweza kukodisha bure.

768
00:43:02,829 --> 00:43:07,162
Imechujwa na kusafishwa vizuri, basi usijali.

769
00:43:07,185 --> 00:43:10,919
Je, mna helmeti za rangi nyeusi na nyeupe?

770
00:43:10,942 --> 00:43:12,075
Ndiyo.

771
00:43:12,098 --> 00:43:15,431
Tuna helmeti nyeusi na nyeupe.

772
00:43:15,454 --> 00:43:18,687
Nitachagua helmeti nyeupe.

773
00:43:18,710 --> 00:43:21,397
Nitakuletea helmeti nyeupe.

774
00:43:21,421 --> 00:43:25,271
Nitakodisha helmeti ya ukubwa L.

775
00:43:25,294 --> 00:43:29,661
Tafadhali endesha kwa upande wa kushoto wa barabara kwa usalama.

776
00:43:29,684 --> 00:43:31,925
Nitaendesha upande wa kushoto.

777
00:43:31,949 --> 00:43:34,786
Endelea na tahadhari.

778
00:43:34,809 --> 00:43:38,575
Asante kwa kukarabati kwa uangalifu.

779
00:43:38,598 --> 00:43:40,732
Asante sana.

780
00:43:40,755 --> 00:43:42,255
Sehemu ya 19: Jinsi ya Kupata Njia za Kuendesha Baiskeli

781
00:43:42,255 --> 00:43:44,111
Samahani.

782
00:43:44,134 --> 00:43:48,822
Ningependa kusikia njia zinazopendekezwa za kuendesha baiskeli.

783
00:43:48,845 --> 00:43:50,578
Karibu sana.

784
00:43:50,601 --> 00:43:54,445
Tafadhali angalia ramani maalum hii.

785
00:43:54,469 --> 00:43:59,715
Barabara maalum ya baiskeli iko wapi?

786
00:43:59,739 --> 00:44:05,672
Njia ya bluu kando ya mto ni barabara maalum ya baiskeli.

787
00:44:05,695 --> 00:44:10,662
Hakuna magari, basi ni salama kuendesha.

788
00:44:10,685 --> 00:44:15,754
Ndiyo, hakuna magari yanayopita, basi ni salama.

789
00:44:15,778 --> 00:44:20,517
Je, naweza kwenda kwenye njia ambayo ina maono ya bahari?

790
00:44:20,540 --> 00:44:25,425
Ndiyo, njia ya pwani ina mandhari ya kupendeza na inapendekezwa.

791
00:44:25,448 --> 00:44:28,782
Njia ya kwenda na kurudi ni kilomita ngapi?

792
00:44:28,805 --> 00:44:33,879
Njia ya kwenda na kurudi ni takriban kilomita 15 kwa wanaoanza.

793
00:44:33,902 --> 00:44:39,435
Kilomita 15 zinaweza kukamilika katika saa mbili hivi.

794
00:44:39,458 --> 00:44:44,425
Baiskeli ya umeme inaweza kupanda milima kwa urahisi.

795
00:44:44,448 --> 00:44:48,281
Je, kuna maeneo ya kupumzika kwenye njia?

796
00:44:48,304 --> 00:44:53,114
Kuna stesheni za barabarani na kafe kila kilomita tano.

797
00:44:53,138 --> 00:44:56,671
Ningependa kula ice cream katika kafe.

798
00:44:56,694 --> 00:45:00,869
Ice cream ya maziwa ya ndani inayofreshi ni tamu sana.

799
00:45:00,892 --> 00:45:05,092
Je, alama za barabarani ni rahisi kuelewa?

800
00:45:05,115 --> 00:45:10,788
Ndiyo, kuna mishale ya bluu kwenye barabara.

801
00:45:10,812 --> 00:45:14,587
Ukiona mshale wa bluu, huta potea njia.

802
00:45:14,611 --> 00:45:18,488
Kuna kishikilia simu kwenye baiskeli pia.

803
00:45:18,511 --> 00:45:21,878
Unatumia ramani kwenye simu wakati wa kuendesha.

804
00:45:21,901 --> 00:45:27,934
Tafadhali angalia watu wanaotembea pia.

805
00:45:27,957 --> 00:45:30,560
Mahali penye watu wengi, punguza kasi.

806
00:45:30,584 --> 00:45:34,865
Usipige kengele, endesha polepole tafadhali.

807
00:45:34,888 --> 00:45:37,921
Usalama kwanza, furahia safari yako.

808
00:45:37,944 --> 00:45:41,957
Furahia mandhari nzuri zaidi wakati wa safari yako.

809
00:45:41,981 --> 00:45:45,314
Je, kuna vyoo kwenye njia?

810
00:45:45,337 --> 00:45:50,737
Ndiyo, kuna vyoo safi kwenye mbuga na vituo vya barabarani.

811
00:45:50,760 --> 00:45:54,294
Vyoo vingi vinawezesha kupumzika kwa amani.

812
00:45:54,317 --> 00:45:57,693
Kuna mashine za kuuza vinywaji vingi pia.

813
00:45:57,716 --> 00:46:02,590
Unaweza kununua maji kwa haraka kwa ajili ya kunywa.

814
00:46:02,614 --> 00:46:05,697
Tafadhali kunywa maji mara kwa mara.

815
00:46:05,721 --> 00:46:08,287
Je, kuna maeneo ya kupiga picha?

816
00:46:08,310 --> 00:46:13,377
Mnara wa kutazama wenye mazingira ya bahari ni eneo bora la kupiga picha.

817
00:46:13,400 --> 00:46:17,276
Nitapiga picha nzuri kwenye mnara wa kutazama.

818
00:46:17,299 --> 00:46:20,766
Utapiga picha nyingi nzuri.

819
00:46:20,789 --> 00:46:24,356
Asante kwa kunifundisha kwa uangalifu.

820
00:46:24,379 --> 00:46:26,712
Safari njema!

821
00:46:26,735 --> 00:46:28,235
Sehemu ya 20: Utaratibu wa Kurudisha Baiskeli

822
00:46:28,235 --> 00:46:30,205
Samahani.

823
00:46:30,228 --> 00:46:33,362
Ningependa kurudisha baiskeli.

824
00:46:33,385 --> 00:46:35,518
Karibu tena.

825
00:46:35,541 --> 00:46:40,008
Tutakubali kurudishiwa hapa kwenye kituo hiki.

826
00:46:40,031 --> 00:46:45,231
Nilikodisha mahali pengine, naweza kurudisha hapa?

827
00:46:45,254 --> 00:46:46,854
Ndiyo.

828
00:46:46,876 --> 00:46:50,365
Hii ni kituo kinachoruhusu kurudisha kwa njia tofauti.

829
00:46:50,388 --> 00:46:53,764
Nitaweka baiskeli kwenye rafu.

830
00:46:53,787 --> 00:46:57,457
Weka gurudumu ndani ya fremu.

831
00:46:57,481 --> 00:47:00,314
Funga kwa ufunguo.

832
00:47:00,337 --> 00:47:01,613
Ndiyo.

833
00:47:01,637 --> 00:47:04,707
Tumethibitisha kuwa ufunguo umefungwa.

834
00:47:04,730 --> 00:47:09,768
Asilimia ya betri iliyobaki ni 20%.

835
00:47:09,792 --> 00:47:14,078
Umeweza kuendesha kwa muda mrefu leo.

836
00:47:14,102 --> 00:47:17,269
Tunakurudishia helmeti na hati yako.

837
00:47:17,292 --> 00:47:20,625
Tunapokea helmeti na hati yako.

838
00:47:20,648 --> 00:47:23,521
Tunakuruhusu ufunguo pia.

839
00:47:23,544 --> 00:47:26,077
Tumepokea ufunguo.

840
00:47:26,100 --> 00:47:29,434
Je, kuna ada ya ziada kwa kurudisha kwa njia tofauti?

841
00:47:29,457 --> 00:47:33,533
Umekwisha kulipa ada ya kurudisha kwa njia tofauti.

842
00:47:33,556 --> 00:47:36,494
Hakuna pesa za ziada zinazohitajika, kweli?

843
00:47:36,518 --> 00:47:37,992
Ndiyo.

844
00:47:38,015 --> 00:47:40,688
Hakuna malipo ya ziada.

845
00:47:40,711 --> 00:47:44,982
Hakikisha hamna chochote ulichokisahau kwenye baiskeli.

846
00:47:45,006 --> 00:47:49,372
Tafadhali angalia kwenye kikapu cha mbele na chini ya kiti.

847
00:47:49,395 --> 00:47:52,595
Hakuna chochote kwenye kikapu.

848
00:47:52,618 --> 00:47:55,952
Tafadhali angalia chini ya kiti pia.

849
00:47:55,975 --> 00:47:58,741
Nimeangalia chini ya kiti.

850
00:47:58,764 --> 00:48:01,298
Hakuna chochote ulichokisahau.

851
00:48:01,321 --> 00:48:04,364
Utaratibu wa kurudisha umekamilika.

852
00:48:04,388 --> 00:48:08,721
Umeona mandhari nzuri wakati wa kuendesha baiskeli.

853
00:48:08,744 --> 00:48:12,781
Hali ya hewa ilikuwa nzuri, safari ya baiskeli ilikuwa bora.

854
00:48:12,805 --> 00:48:16,338
Je, bidhaa maalum za kituo hiki ni zipi?

855
00:48:16,361 --> 00:48:21,565
Juisi ya chungwa na aiskrimu ni maarufu hapa.

856
00:48:21,589 --> 00:48:24,923
Nitanunua juisi tamu ya chungwa na kunywa.

857
00:48:24,946 --> 00:48:27,550
Hupatikani katika sehemu ya zawadi.

858
00:48:27,574 --> 00:48:30,625
Nitapata pia zawadi za kisnacki za kuleta nyumbani.

859
00:48:30,648 --> 00:48:34,381
Tafadhali furahia ladha ya eneo hilo.

860
00:48:34,404 --> 00:48:38,538
Baiskeli iliyokodishwa imefanya siku yangu kuwa bora kabisa.

861
00:48:38,561 --> 00:48:42,694
Tunawaita kwa shauku kujiunga nasi tena.

862
00:48:42,717 --> 00:48:45,152
Kituo cha basi kiko wapi?

863
00:48:45,176 --> 00:48:49,709
Kituo cha basi kipo mbele ya mlango wa mbele wa kituo cha barabarani.

864
00:48:49,732 --> 00:48:52,067
Nitakwenda kwenye stesheni kwa basi.

865
00:48:52,090 --> 00:48:55,224
Safari njema kwenu.

866
00:48:55,247 --> 00:48:58,425
Asante kwa kushughulikia kwa uangalifu.

867
00:48:58,448 --> 00:49:00,848
Asante sana.